00:26:05.670 --> 00:26:08.690
NFC and cashless
payments is something

00:26:08.690 --> 00:26:11.760
I'm really excited
to see developing

00:26:11.760 --> 00:26:13.220
across the continent.

00:26:13.220 --> 00:26:21.210
Carrying cash can be dangerous
and without the technology

00:26:21.210 --> 00:26:24.920
to replace cash,
there's no other option.

00:26:24.920 --> 00:26:28.150
It needs to be fast and easy.

00:26:28.150 --> 00:26:31.890
And with NFC and
contactless payments,

00:26:31.890 --> 00:26:35.070
it allows you to not have
to carry cash around.

00:26:35.070 --> 00:26:39.010
So as people get more phones,
and they move their cash

00:26:39.010 --> 00:26:43.730
into bank accounts, and hardware
manufacturers start supporting

00:26:43.730 --> 00:26:45.940
NFC and contactless
payments, I think,

00:26:45.940 --> 00:26:47.870
it's going to be a
really exciting space.

00:26:47.870 --> 00:26:49.710
HIREN PATEL: Yeah, and
