and start working on it.

00:30:43.040 --> 00:30:46.486
And once you're-- so
it's basically like that

00:30:46.486 --> 00:30:49.540
deteriorated mode, where you
don't have access to the full

00:30:49.540 --> 00:30:52.922
functionality, but still you
can get working and do a lot

00:30:52.922 --> 00:30:54.880
of stuff with your
application, which is great.

00:30:54.880 --> 00:30:55.470
I really like it.

00:30:55.470 --> 00:30:56.511
MARK MANDEL: Really nice.

00:30:56.511 --> 00:30:57.570
I really like that too.

